 pitch, please purchase a Pitch Ticket and fill out the Pitch Application Form. We will contact you to discuss and approve your pitch. The pitch duration is 5 minutes. You will also have some time to answer questions from the audience.\n\n**How does the pitch go?**\nSelected founders present on stage to the audience and the investors in the room. You get 5 minutes to pitch your idea, business model, target market, and investment ask, followed by a short Q&A. The best startups are featured across our social media channels and in the investor newsletter.\n\n**Who will I meet?**\nFounders, angel investors, VC partners, venture scouts, AI experts, engineers, operators, marketing and sales experts, and international entrepreneurs from across Europe, Asia, and the US.\n\n**Do investors get free tickets?**\nYes! Please apply via Luma (the link is in the event description) or email hello@startupvalley.club, and we will issue a complimentary ticket for you and your team.\n\n**Can I request a refund?**\nYes. Refunds are available if requested at least 1 day before the event start time. Please submit the refund request on the platform where you purchased your ticket, or email us at hello@startupvalley.club","startDate":"2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Kos Restaurant","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"61 Bellevue Avenue, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Startups & Tech Events in Toronto","url":"https://www.meetup.com/startup-valley-toronto/"},"performer":"Startups & Tech Events in Toronto"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Tech Networking Event by Startup Valley in  Toronto ","url":"https://www.meetup.com/startup-valley